[00:01.18]1. As Jehovah’s people sound throughout the earth
[00:07.32]Truths about the Kingdom and its priceless worth,
[00:13.44]Theocratic order they must all obey
[00:19.42]And remain united, loyalty display.
[00:25.42](Chorus)
[00:26.16]Loyal submission in recognition,
[00:32.26]This to our God we owe.
[00:38.40]He gives protection, tender affection,
[00:43.98]Loyalty to him we show.
[00:49.92]2. God provides his steward and his active force.
[00:56.36]These will ever guide us in our Christian course.
[01:02.68]So may we be steadfast, seeking God to please,
[01:08.78]Loyally proclaiming all his wise decrees!
[01:14.68](Chorus)
[01:15.32]Loyal submission in recognition,
[01:21.10]This to our God we owe.
[01:26.94]He gives protection, tender affection,
[01:33.06]Loyalty to him we show.
